        "original_id": "1d26241e-7646-5dac-a375-0d6baa503e33",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Stephens, James Hewitt, Gillian Caldwell, Tess Daly, Richard Bacon, Maureen Rees, Craig Phillips\n- Organizations: Howard Kennedy LLP, Global Witness, British Army\n- Topics: media law, intellectual property rights, human rights\n- Events: Back to Reality\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Stephens was born on 7 April 1957.\n- James Hewitt was born on 30 April 1958.\n- Mark Stephens is an English solicitor specialising in media law, intellectual property rights, and human rights with Howard Kennedy LLP.\n- James Hewitt is an English former cavalry officer in the British Army.\n- Gillian Caldwell joined Global Witness as Executive Director in July 2015.\n- Mark Stephens was appointed Chair of Global Witness in March 2016.\n- Tess Daly and Richard Bacon presented Back to Reality.\n- James Hewitt won the first and only series of Back to Reality ahead of Maureen Rees and Craig Phillips.",
